            {
                "entry_id": "f8a2bc67-5dca-33dc-9520-ca02e4ef5f27",
                "word": "viandeux",
                "pos": "adj",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "c93d7780-4c68-4472-9351-d6d31c938d85",
                        "entry_id": "f8a2bc67-5dca-33dc-9520-ca02e4ef5f27",
                        "tags": [
                            "singular",
                            "feminine"
                        ],
                        "form": "viandeuse"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "57897d49-4cd0-4787-9a76-14256c8a264e",
                        "entry_id": "f8a2bc67-5dca-33dc-9520-ca02e4ef5f27",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "feminine"
                        ],
                        "form": "viandeuses"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "86508f2e-9b11-3cfe-98a7-3f9805a27cdb",
                        "entry_id": "f8a2bc67-5dca-33dc-9520-ca02e4ef5f27",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Se dit d’un animal de boucherie bien fourni en viande, en particulier par opposition avec les animaux destinés à la production laitière."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Belgique"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "cbeea867-4825-4cf1-ba77-a24d458632cb",
                                "sense_id": "86508f2e-9b11-3cfe-98a7-3f9805a27cdb",
                                "text": "Contrairement à ce que nous pouvons observer en races laitières, en races viandeuses, il n’existe pas une race prédominante à travers le monde."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4a193102-7707-4c98-817c-c31e674d74da",
                                "sense_id": "86508f2e-9b11-3cfe-98a7-3f9805a27cdb",
                                "text": "Pour enregistrer une croissance optimale et produire beaucoup de viande, le cheptel viandeux a besoin d’une ration riche en protéines."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4cbfef50-e8ff-4071-9c26-f4a53213686a",
                                "sense_id": "86508f2e-9b11-3cfe-98a7-3f9805a27cdb",
                                "text": "Étant donné le succès rapide de cette sélection au départ d’un type mixte ayant conduit à ce que les éleveurs belges appellent le type viandeux s’ajoutant à la similitude de morphologie avec le cul de poulain, ou culard, qui naît sporadiquement dans différentes races bovines européennes, on avait de fortes raisons de suspecter l’intervention d’un gène à effet majeur."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "4b27f15d-1b38-3da0-ab0e-dba7f9d29c45",
                        "entry_id": "f8a2bc67-5dca-33dc-9520-ca02e4ef5f27",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Plat ou recette riche en viande, carné."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "broadly"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "8f1a898d-90c9-4230-a86f-0ec035b9a49a",
                                "sense_id": "4b27f15d-1b38-3da0-ab0e-dba7f9d29c45",
                                "text": "Pour déguster des saveurs italiennes en plein hiver québécois, voici la recette de ragoût de chou viandeux de Stefano Faita!"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1d64b54a-10b4-40bd-8456-1c0b9813614a",
                                "sense_id": "4b27f15d-1b38-3da0-ab0e-dba7f9d29c45",
                                "text": "Grâce aux lentilles vertes qui donnent de la texture en mijotant avec le reste des ingrédients, on obtient un chili bien épais, charnu et \"viandeux\", comme on aime."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "e1a51b02-7cab-43a4-8018-5979733fa772",
                        "source_entry_id": "f8a2bc67-5dca-33dc-9520-ca02e4ef5f27",
                        "target_lang_word": "fleshy",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "fleshy",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "71360f95-660c-324f-a0a9-0d38e9c1a176",
                                        "entry_id": "e6373d5e-cab3-3d7c-80fa-3ee284731011",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Of, related to, or resembling flesh."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e104b6fa-a212-4cac-9068-ce76de8568e1",
                                                "sense_id": "71360f95-660c-324f-a0a9-0d38e9c1a176",
                                                "text": "Mr. Creakle . . . showed me the cane, and asked me what I thought of THAT? . . . Did it bite? At every question he gave me a fleshy cut with it that made me writhe."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "80898c11-36c6-4cea-8d4d-4bb9baf07bff",
                                                "sense_id": "71360f95-660c-324f-a0a9-0d38e9c1a176",
                                                "text": "[O]ver reefs and banks of shining rock, a bristling beard of spiky and fleshy vegetation was straining into view."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e456e54d-0085-3c94-811a-6d42163e79e0",
                                        "entry_id": "e6373d5e-cab3-3d7c-80fa-3ee284731011",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Having considerable flesh; plump."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "of a person"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6b831b89-fe5d-44cd-88d9-acf7788f6d4d",
                                                "sense_id": "e456e54d-0085-3c94-811a-6d42163e79e0",
                                                "text": "The King's face was slightly more fleshy than mine, the oval of its contour the least trifle more pronounced."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8903df2f-7005-44c1-859b-d334b37345eb",
                                                "sense_id": "e456e54d-0085-3c94-811a-6d42163e79e0",
                                                "text": "He was a large fleshy man, weighing at least two hundred pounds, and he quickly became a faithful representation of a quivering jelly-mountain of fat."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ee5ad086-7140-4e1f-a73f-7a90ce3d995c",
                                                "sense_id": "e456e54d-0085-3c94-811a-6d42163e79e0",
                                                "text": "It's hard to imagine why Flemish Renaissance artist Peter Paul Rubens would paint a blemish on the backside of one of the fleshy lovelies meant to represent beauty, charm and good cheer, but there's no denying that single red brushstroke in the midst of his central figure's creamy skin."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "43b7b9e3-206c-356c-a90f-622c0f4a08e3",
                                        "entry_id": "e6373d5e-cab3-3d7c-80fa-3ee284731011",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Rich and smooth, with significant body or texture."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2ce97ac3-df41-4898-9067-50fd3751182b",
                                                "sense_id": "43b7b9e3-206c-356c-a90f-622c0f4a08e3",
                                                "text": "a fleshy wine"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "851fabad-fe71-4143-8a83-b5c2359744ff",
                        "source_entry_id": "f8a2bc67-5dca-33dc-9520-ca02e4ef5f27",
                        "target_lang_word": "meaty",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "meaty",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cd8c2846-b005-3556-9aa8-e4c64de5ae86",
                                        "entry_id": "72809417-1225-378f-aba6-26bd042ab436",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Of, relating to, or containing meat."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "41ac9c7c-eaba-4388-903a-5d0162770047",
                                                "sense_id": "cd8c2846-b005-3556-9aa8-e4c64de5ae86",
                                                "text": "In the early years of this century most Americans did not question the meaty, starchy, saladless national diet."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cabd4378-c20f-3697-85d7-035b95a2fc35",
                                        "entry_id": "72809417-1225-378f-aba6-26bd042ab436",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Resembling meat in flavour, smell, etc."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a040c8f2-5c20-4a63-975c-002d84e70608",
                                                "sense_id": "cabd4378-c20f-3697-85d7-035b95a2fc35",
                                                "text": "This tastes rather meaty. Are you sure it's vegetarian?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "151e2e55-3704-4b91-b13c-28b7f6e57144",
                                                "sense_id": "cabd4378-c20f-3697-85d7-035b95a2fc35",
                                                "text": "\"He's a foreign-looking guy with thinnish black hair and a meaty sort of pan.\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "74288b33-0029-403e-a850-cbc652a2cac5",
                                                "sense_id": "cabd4378-c20f-3697-85d7-035b95a2fc35",
                                                "text": "The warm, comforting, meaty smell of khorovadz drifted into the café from a stall on the pavement; the quiet mutters that had till then passed for conversation in the café began to buzz with passion and interest."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "27cdb549-a61a-4bfe-a838-dfda724f6ce6",
                                                "sense_id": "cabd4378-c20f-3697-85d7-035b95a2fc35",
                                                "text": "The slightly sulfurous, meaty odor of morels attracts flies, which lay eggs in the safety of the mushroom's hollow stalk."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b105dab5-5c75-37f4-a9bb-eeb445d49863",
                                        "entry_id": "72809417-1225-378f-aba6-26bd042ab436",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Of a person or a body part, large and solid."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "abc6ff04-b501-4d55-a174-08c552875648",
                                                "sense_id": "b105dab5-5c75-37f4-a9bb-eeb445d49863",
                                                "text": "The whole, long, thick, meaty shaft of it quivered as if eager to dispel my mouth. Odor assailed me, too – my brother, like so many soldiers, not being overly fastidious in matters of personal hygiene. \"All right, my little whoreling,\" he commanded, [...]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b7ecd813-f830-4420-866b-f5902d340f23",
                                                "sense_id": "b105dab5-5c75-37f4-a9bb-eeb445d49863",
                                                "text": "There’s nothing worse than having cashed out the college fund so that Mom and Dad and Buddy and Sis can afford airfare to Wally World, only to find out that they are additionally facing bag fees and snack fees, and soon enough, there will likely be a fee to have the 350-pound man sausaged next to Sis in the middle seat keep his meaty elbows out of her ribcage."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5f071ea1-ecb2-4dfa-a879-91eba9b8c1d9",
                                                "sense_id": "b105dab5-5c75-37f4-a9bb-eeb445d49863",
                                                "text": "When he tried to extract the liver, which should have been firm and meaty, it deliquesced into a bloody sludge, sliding goopily through his fingers."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "66106ffe-73f6-386d-9905-094977ad05bb",
                                        "entry_id": "72809417-1225-378f-aba6-26bd042ab436",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Substantial."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "94ff0708-649c-4241-beaf-4428bf4671b1",
                                                "sense_id": "66106ffe-73f6-386d-9905-094977ad05bb",
                                                "text": "I got a nice, meaty bonus."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "27c9b878-4151-4329-9a2a-d25aa1cc11c2",
                                                "sense_id": "66106ffe-73f6-386d-9905-094977ad05bb",
                                                "text": "He scored a meaty role in the film, with plenty of action and dialogue."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6b429c10-6922-409b-b06d-c361158be387",
                                                "sense_id": "66106ffe-73f6-386d-9905-094977ad05bb",
                                                "text": "I’ve always played my class – either working-class characters or ones where it’s not been mentioned – so this was quite scary. It’s also a meaty part. I’ve never had this many lines in a play."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c1bc853f-67a2-4897-9d2c-3723ec60d187",
                                                "sense_id": "66106ffe-73f6-386d-9905-094977ad05bb",
                                                "text": "Alexander-Arnold had a few nice moments on the ball before the interval. He also had a bad one when his loose touch allowed Zivkovic to supply Mitrovic for a meaty drive that flew wide."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f31885ff-dbf6-44a4-be56-63a9424c1c7f",
